many issues exist 👇

(A) Linear Relationship

👉 Straight-line pattern

Best Algorithms:
Linear Regression (baseline)
Ridge / Lasso ⭐ (regularization)


(B) Non-linear Relationship

👉 Real-world data mostly non-linear

Best Algorithms:
Decision Tree
Random Forest ⭐
XGBoost / LightGBM ⭐⭐⭐
Neural Networks

(C) Outliers Problem ⚠️

👉 Extreme values break model

Best Algorithms:
Robust Regression
Tree-based models (Random Forest, XGBoost) ⭐

(D) High-Dimensional Data

👉 Too many features

Best Algorithms:
Lasso (feature selection) ⭐
Ridge
ElasticNet

(E) Time Series Regression

👉 Data depends on time

Best Algorithms:
ARIMA
LSTM ⭐ (deep learning)
Prophet


Quick Comparison (VERY IMPORTANT)

| Situation     | Best Algorithm                  |
| ------------- | ------------------------------- |
| Small data    | Logistic / Linear               |
| Large data    | XGBoost / LightGBM ⭐            |
| Non-linear    | Random Forest / Boosting        |
| Imbalanced    | XGBoost + class_weight          |
| High features | Lasso / Ridge                   |
| Text data     | Naive Bayes / TF-IDF + Logistic |
| Image data    | CNN ⭐                           |
| Time series   | ARIMA / LSTM                    |

